{"availability":"available","full":"postscarcityai/yuigui","name":"yuigui","description":"Yui hub: roadmap, progress, Yui Lines spec + playground. Lives at yuigui.com","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":1,"created":"2026-09-23T22:40:36Z","updated":"2026-10-09T22:50:27Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://www.yuigui.com","topics":["ai-agents","generative-ui","hermes-agent","open-source","swiftui"],"demo":"https://www.yuigui.com/playground","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T15:48:53.779Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T15:48:53.779Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T15:48:53.779Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T07:34:29.849Z","stars":1,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-10T17:28:21.442Z","stars":1,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-16T15:48:53.779Z","stars":1,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Meet Yui, a generative user interface. Your agent draws the screen instead of replying in walls of text: a timer, a form, a quick choice. You chat like normal, and when a button or a timer would work better than text, the agent puts one on the screen. Your taps go straight back to it. Native on iPhone, Hermes first.","It is not another chatbot. Yui brings no brain of its own. You bring the agent (Hermes first, others later), and Yui gives it a face, a voice and a screen it can draw on.","This repo is the hub: the public roadmap, the progress log, the Yui Lines spec and the site at yuigui.com. The iOS app and the Hermes plugin live in postscarcityai/yui."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/postscarcityai/yuigui/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b19fd63053ffc836e9b0a7c3ab8522f158029567b9af7778a73df5ebf9c78b7d","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T07:34:30.020Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:34:30.020Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Meet Yui, a generative user interface. Your agent draws the screen instead of replying in walls of text